@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:——过了几天。|#0203Adv09_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:自那之后，<br>我们一同尽心尽力投入到舞台剧的制作当中。|#0203Adv09_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后——|#0203Adv09_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:6_1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

[PrintTextModified Text:各位，可以听我说几句吗。|#0203Adv09_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:晚餐时刻。<br>蕾雅突然站起来向所有人说道。|#0203Adv09_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:首先请允许我在此向各位道谢。<br>衷心感谢大家。|#0203Adv09_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅把手放在胸口，<br>恭敬地鞠了一躬。|#0203Adv09_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:多亏大家的努力，<br>舞台剧的制作进展非常顺利。|#0203Adv09_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从剧本、服装，到背景制作、演技训练……<br>|#0203Adv09_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在这几天里，我们一路同心协力，<br>只为打造一场舞台剧。|#0203Adv09_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就连一开始那么抗拒的亚里沙，<br>也在不知不觉中参与进来。|#0203Adv09_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我也在调查大魔女的空余时间内<br>尽所能地提供协助。|#0203Adv09_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Default
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:我自然而然地看向安安。<br>她应该也是一直看着我，我们的视线重合了。|#0203Adv09_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0203Adv09_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（哎呀呀）|#0203Adv09_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可能是感到窘迫吧，安安马上低下了头。<br>我轻轻叹了一口气。|#0203Adv09_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:明天，我们的舞台剧终于要正式开演。|#0203Adv09_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅郑重其事地说道。|#0203Adv09_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:唔、唔唔，马上就要正式上场了呢。<br>我能好好演完吗……|#0203Adv09_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我们花了这么多时间精力去练习，没问题的！<br>如果发生什么万一，我也会来圆场！|#0203Adv09_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你这听起来也不怎么能让人放心啊……<br>不过嘛，我觉得艾玛肯定能演好。|#0203Adv09_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:咦？<br>难不成这是在暗指我演不好？|#0203Adv09_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对紧张的艾玛，<br>雪莉和汉娜努力安抚。|#0203Adv09_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:已经尽最大努力反复练习过了，<br>所以你可以自信一点……|#0203Adv09_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来她们的鼓励<br>让艾玛放下了一些心理负担。|#0203Adv09_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉，汉娜……<br>谢谢你们！|#0203Adv09_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:安安，<br>剧本已经没有什么需要修改的地方了对吧？|#0203Adv09_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，不用担心。<br>剧本真的写得很精彩哦！|#0203Adv09_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，我光是读剧本就已经觉得很感人了。<br>安安真的很厉害呢。我也会加油的。|#0203Adv09_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

; 椅子から立ち上がる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_136 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:这时安安突然站了起来。<br>她惊恐得脸色发青。|#0203Adv09_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Fearful1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:……不对。我要坦白。|#0203Adv09_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……|#0203Adv09_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn

[PrintTextModified Text:写出剧本的人，不是吾辈。|#0203Adv09_AnAn003| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_9_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:安安挤出的这句话里掺杂着苦涩。|#0203Adv09_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:吾辈，根本没写多少。<br>所以说，那是让希罗帮忙，<br>甚至可以说，几乎都是希罗写出来的，作品……|#0203Adv09_AnAn004| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（用不着特意说出来吧……<br>　但我能理解她无法释怀的心情）|#0203Adv09_Hiro002|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:这是什么时候的事……？<br>诺亚怎么完全不知道。|#0203Adv09_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:吾辈写不出来，<br>希罗察觉到这一点后，就到图书室陪吾辈一起写……|#0203Adv09_AnAn005| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:可剧情不都是你想出来的吗？<br>那你就是参与了啊。|#0203Adv09_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:就是啊！<br>剧本是你跟希罗两个人携手创作出来的！|#0203Adv09_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Cry1

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0203Adv09_AnAn006| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安却没能接受这些安慰的话语，<br>早已泪眼汪汪。|#0203Adv09_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我走到安安身旁，<br>轻轻把手放在她的头上。|#0203Adv09_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:确实大部分都是我在写。<br>可是你也没有逃避，一直努力到最后。|#0203Adv09_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了写出自己认为有趣的作品，<br>你一直都在用心对待这份工作。|#0203Adv09_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这些我都看在眼里，我很清楚这一点。|#0203Adv09_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:……嗯、嗯，诺亚也是！<br>诺亚也很清楚，<br>安安很拼命很努力！|#0203Adv09_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:没错，大叔我也看到了哦。<br>安安真的很认真。|#0203Adv09_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Default
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn

[PrintTextModified Text:你胸怀如此强大的意志，<br>今后会有长足进步的。|#0203Adv09_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你将来不是要当文豪吗？<br>努力创作下一部作品就好。我很期待哦。|#0203Adv09_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:安安终于打起精神抬起了头。|#0203Adv09_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:没、没错……！<br>吾辈终有一天会当上文豪。<br>等、等着瞧吧……！|#0203Adv09_AnAn007| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:下次吾辈一定会写出一部<br>让所有人感动得说不出话的巨作……！|#0203Adv09_AnAn008| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:好。期待你的杰作。|#0203Adv09_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安充满朝气的宣言<br>让在场一众少女之间的紧张气氛缓和了不少。|#0203Adv09_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:还有诺亚还有诺亚！大家听诺亚说！<br>背景虽然还剩一点没画完……<br>能有机会画画，诺亚真的好开心～|#0203Adv09_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:做布景的时候啊，<br>亚里沙帮了诺亚很多很多哦。|#0203Adv09_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Flushed1

[PrintTextModified Text:啧，谁叫你老在中庭晃悠，我是没办法才做。|#0203Adv09_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（——蕾雅的计划很顺利）|#0203Adv09_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我打从心底地感受到。|#0203Adv09_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:通过制作这场舞台剧，<br>确实加深了彼此之间的交流。<br>我甚至觉得，我们之间正在开始产生一种无法割舍的纽带。|#0203Adv09_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（即使不论那些，上演舞台剧这件事本身就让我非常期待……）|#0203Adv09_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:就让典狱长和看守一起来欣赏<br>我们倾心打造的精彩表演吧。|#0203Adv09_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只要看到我们之间关系有多么融洽，联系有多么紧密，<br>说不定它们就会改变心意。|#0203Adv09_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅眼中散发着光彩，<br>满怀热情地谈着心中理想。|#0203Adv09_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——这群少女同心协力打造出一场舞台剧，并且这期间无人被杀，<br>所以她们已经不会再变成魔女了。<br>让它们得出这样的结论，并释放所有人。|#0203Adv09_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果事情能这样发展，那该有多好。|#0203Adv09_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:说得对……嗯，加油吧！|#0203Adv09_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅说的这些，说到底只是理想化的愿望。<br>尽管如此，她们也想要心怀希望吧。|#0203Adv09_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大家都认同这个理想，为了正式上演，<br>正在不断巩固彼此之间的团结。|#0203Adv09_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:与此同时，我的心中也怀着一份冷静。|#0203Adv09_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只是让它们看一场舞台剧，<br>不可能让我们的状况发生任何改变。|#0203Adv09_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（就算是这样，这一切也有意义）|#0203Adv09_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:巩固彼此的关系确实有效。<br>最近这几天，完全没有会发生凶杀案的氛围。|#0203Adv09_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:据我所知，这几天大家没有发生任何争执，<br>日子过得非常平和。|#0203Adv09_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我跟艾玛之间的关系依然别扭。|#0203Adv09_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不再让任何人继续牺牲，<br>并制裁一切不幸的元凶——大魔女。|#0203Adv09_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这些一定都会顺利实现。|#0203Adv09_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我并不会胸怀这种天真的理想，<br>但这几天的经历，让我也逐渐变得积极乐观起来。|#0203Adv09_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv

